{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-bottlenecks","title":"CPU 瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu/cpu-bottlenecks","wordCount":1813,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"cpu-瓶颈\">CPU 瓶颈</h1><p>当 <a href=\"../foundations/profiling-methodology\">剖析方法论</a>告诉你这一帧是 CPU 受限——GPU 在干等 CPU 喂活——下一步就是揪出 CPU 上的时间到底花在了哪。CPU 瓶颈和 GPU 瓶颈的性质完全不同：GPU 是并行流水线，CPU（尤其是主线程）是一条串行长队，任何一个失控的子系统都能把整条队堵死。这一节讲怎么定位主线程上的热点，以及对症的削减策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏的 CPU 工作绝大部分压在主线程（游戏线程）上，因为玩法逻辑天然有顺序依赖。下图展示主线程上典型的串行工作流，其中任意一段膨胀都会顶满 <a href=\"../foundations/frame-budget\">帧预算</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[主线程帧开始] --&gt; B[输入与事件处理]&#10;  B --&gt; C[游戏逻辑 / AI / 状态机]&#10;  C --&gt; D[物理步进]&#10;  D --&gt; E[动画更新]&#10;  E --&gt; F[场景图遍历与变换]&#10;  F --&gt; G[剔除]&#10;  G --&gt; H[绘制调用准备与提交]&#10;  H --&gt; I[帧结束]&#10;  C -.热点常见来源.-&gt; J[每帧重复计算&lt;br/&gt;错误数据结构&lt;br/&gt;过度分配触发 GC]\">flowchart TD\n  A[主线程帧开始] --&gt; B[输入与事件处理]\n  B --&gt; C[游戏逻辑 / AI / 状态机]\n  C --&gt; D[物理步进]\n  D --&gt; E[动画更新]\n  E --&gt; F[场景图遍历与变换]\n  F --&gt; G[剔除]\n  G --&gt; H[绘制调用准备与提交]\n  H --&gt; I[帧结束]\n  C -.热点常见来源.-&gt; J[每帧重复计算&lt;br/&gt;错误数据结构&lt;br/&gt;过度分配触发 GC]</pre><p>CPU 瓶颈大体分三类来源：算法层面的低效（错误的复杂度或数据结构）、调用层面的浪费（重复计算、过度的引擎 API 调用）、以及隐藏开销（内存分配触发的垃圾回收、跨语言边界的封送）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算法复杂度-最大的杠杆\">算法复杂度：最大的杠杆</h2><p>在 CPU 优化里，没有什么比修正算法复杂度回报更高。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的实现，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 从 100 涨到 1000 时会慢一百倍，而换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只慢约十五倍。游戏里最常见的复杂度陷阱是「每个对象遍历所有其他对象」——朴素的碰撞检测、AI 感知、最近邻查询，写不好都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>解法通常是引入空间数据结构。把世界划分成网格（uniform grid）、四叉树、八叉树或 BVH，让每个对象只检查邻近格子里的对象，把复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。下表对比几种常见的复杂度优化场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>朴素做法</th>\n<th>优化做法</th>\n<th>复杂度变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碰撞 / 邻近查询</td>\n<td>两两比较</td>\n<td>空间哈希 / 四叉树</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2) \\to O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频繁查找</td>\n<td>线性扫数组</td>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n) \\to O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序绘制</td>\n<td>每帧全排序</td>\n<td>增量 / 桶排序</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n) \\to O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径搜索</td>\n<td>每帧重算</td>\n<td>缓存 + 分摊</td>\n<td>大幅下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>修算法之前务必先用剖析确认它真是热点——一个只在加载时跑一次的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不值得优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消除每帧重复计算\">消除每帧重复计算</h2><p>第二类常见浪费是把本该算一次的东西每帧都算一遍。典型的例子：每帧重新计算一个不变的变换矩阵、每帧查找同一个组件引用、每帧分配一个临时容器、每帧拼接调试字符串。单次开销看似微小，乘以每秒几十帧再乘以成百上千个对象，就成了可观的预算消耗。</p>\n<p>对策是缓存与脏标记。把计算结果缓存起来，只有当输入真正变化时才重算（脏标记模式）。把引擎 API 查找（如 GetComponent、Find）提到初始化阶段一次性缓存引用，而不是每帧调用——这类 API 往往比看上去贵。还有事件驱动替代轮询：与其每帧检查「玩家进入触发区了吗」，不如用碰撞回调在事件发生时才响应。这些手段共同的思路是「把工作从热路径里搬走」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐藏开销-垃圾回收与封送\">隐藏开销：垃圾回收与封送</h2><p>托管语言（C# 之于 Unity、蓝图/脚本层之于其他引擎）带来一类隐蔽的 CPU 瓶颈：内存分配触发的垃圾回收。每次在热路径里 new 一个对象、装箱一个值类型、用 LINQ 产生临时迭代器，都在堆上留下垃圾。当垃圾积累到阈值，GC 会暂停主线程去回收，造成一根帧时间尖峰——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/profiling-methodology\">剖析方法论</a>里说的那类卡顿。对策是在热路径里做到零分配：复用缓冲、用对象池、避免装箱、避免会隐式分配的 API。对象池的具体做法见 <a href=\"../gpu-memory/memory-management\">内存管理</a>。</p>\n<p>另一类隐藏开销是跨边界封送（marshalling）。脚本层调用引擎原生代码、或托管代码与原生代码互相传数据，每次跨越都有固定成本。在循环里频繁地从脚本读写一个原生属性，累积起来会很贵。对策是批量化跨边界调用、把数据成块传递而非逐个传递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据结构与访问模式\">数据结构与访问模式</h2><p>算法对了、不重复算了、不乱分配了之后，下一层 CPU 优化进入内存访问的领域：同样复杂度的算法，因为内存布局不同，速度能差好几倍。一个用链表或散落对象实现的遍历，会因为缓存未命中而远慢于紧凑数组上的同样遍历。这已经触及面向数据设计的核心，本节只点到为止——它是一个足够大的主题，完整展开见 <a href=\"cache-data-oriented\">缓存与数据导向</a>。</p>\n<p>同理，当你已经把主线程的算法和访问模式都优化到位、单核仍然不够用时，下一个杠杆是把无依赖的工作摊到多个核心，这是 <a href=\"multithreading-jobs\">多线程与作业系统</a>的领域。三者的正确顺序是：先砍掉冗余工作和修复算法，再优化缓存访问，最后才并行化——否则只是用更多核心更快地做错的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"更新策略-不是所有东西都要每帧算\">更新策略：不是所有东西都要每帧算</h2><p>主线程预算最隐蔽的浪费，是让一堆其实不需要每帧更新的逻辑挤在每一帧里跑。一个远处的 AI 不需要每帧重新规划路径，一段背景动画不需要每帧以全精度求值，一个慢变的 UI 数值不需要每帧刷新。把这些工作按重要性和距离分级、降低更新频率，能立竿见影地腾出预算。</p>\n<p>常见手法有几种。时间分片（time-slicing）把一项大工作摊到若干帧上完成，比如把一千个对象的 AI 更新分成十帧、每帧只更新一百个，削平单帧峰值。基于距离/重要性的更新（类似几何上的 LOD，但作用于逻辑）让远处或不重要的对象以更低频率更新——远处敌人每五帧才思考一次，玩家根本察觉不到。事件驱动替代轮询则如前所述，只在状态真正变化时才响应。这些策略的共同思想是：把工作量在时间维度上摊开、按需分配，而不是让所有东西争抢同一帧的预算。它们和后面的 <a href=\"multithreading-jobs\">多线程</a>互补——一个在时间上摊，一个在空间（核心）上摊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CPU 工作多集中在串行的主线程，任一子系统膨胀都会顶满预算。</li>\n<li>修正算法复杂度是回报最高的杠杆，用空间数据结构把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>消除每帧重复计算：缓存结果、脏标记、提前缓存引擎 API 查找、事件驱动替代轮询。</li>\n<li>托管语言要警惕 GC 引发的帧尖峰，在热路径做到零分配；减少跨语言边界封送。</li>\n<li>优化顺序：先砍冗余与修算法（本节）→ 优化缓存访问（<a href=\"cache-data-oriented\">数据导向</a>）→ 并行化（<a href=\"multithreading-jobs\">多线程</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CPU 瓶颈","id":"cpu-瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"算法复杂度：最大的杠杆","id":"算法复杂度-最大的杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"消除每帧重复计算","id":"消除每帧重复计算"},{"level":2,"text":"隐藏开销：垃圾回收与封送","id":"隐藏开销-垃圾回收与封送"},{"level":2,"text":"数据结构与访问模式","id":"数据结构与访问模式"},{"level":2,"text":"更新策略：不是所有东西都要每帧算","id":"更新策略-不是所有东西都要每帧算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剖析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/foundations/profiling-methodology"},"next":{"title":"缓存与数据导向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented"}}